dFEOTl1pdYVmPiP95VTleWqrRxZg&oe=6A81B013"}, {"file_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator_SS_05.png", "id": "837151848339615", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43931336_837151851672948_3791241212278429846_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NLGDmmGq9NMQ7kNvwH0Focs&_nc_oc=AdqXTkaaNhqwerw1BUNvA61ubVubI9s_uB8gTnM_zNv2VryDWx8I6_k3VtsfTNdqNQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFIo5gPx9uP1g4wnTufIA2H_Jasx0LY9vwi7nomP-fsTw&oe=6A81A327"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440.png", "id": "3812821238933502", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982527_3812821242266835_422188521434867194_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q2wtBuy9f0EQ7kNvwGl3bM-&_nc_oc=Adoe_ouXko2KBK6e3NkoaYEhpZp6WUYa8oBiEqhdPDS46_-g9ScNqC5DfW81YZfPdxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH43KSEsALTSvZy5mMnnhvpu9FIyzzl7-H8W2ZxhBLf6A&oe=6A81C14C"}, "display_name": "Recording Radial Pulse Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This tutorial covers the essential steps for measuring and recording a patient's radial pulse. It includes preparation, locating the pulse, measurement, and documentation. By the end of this tutorial, learners will be able to: \n\nRemember the key steps in recording a radial pulse. \n- Understand the significance of pulse measurement in patient assessment. \n- Apply the correct techniques to ensure accurate pulse recording. \n- Analyze pulse data to detect any irregularities. \n- Evaluate their measurement accuracy and identify areas for improvement. \n- Create precise and thorough patient records based on their findings. \n\nThis comprehensive approach ensures CNAs are well-prepared to assist patients with feeding efficiently and compassionately in real-world clinical settings. ", "short_description": "Develop proficiency in accurately recording a patient's radial pulse."}]}, "developer_name": null, 